<title>USA: F &amp; M Bancorp completes East Troy deal.</title>
<headline>F &amp; M Bancorp completes East Troy deal.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>F &amp; M Bancorp Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of State Bank of East Troy, a $55 million asset bank located in East Troy, Wisconsin.</p>
<p>F &amp; M said in August the purchase would be made for an undisclosed amount of stock.</p>
<p>Shares of F &amp; M, which has assets of about $1.2 billion, were unchanged at 30-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
